      "cooked": "<p>Not sure if this has been addressed anywhere, but I had an interaction I didn't understand.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>La Capitan stole the Void Cloak from Writhe and put it under her deck. His turn came up, and i tried to use a card to destroy it. \"Void Cloak is not in play\" it tells me. Okay, fine. I use his power to retrieve the Void Cloak. \"Void Cloak is already in play.\"</p>\n<p>I kind of get what the intended outcome would be, here, since the power lets you search deck or trash. Still, this outcome was a bit odd, at least in the wording of the messages.&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:07.257Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
