      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Not sure if this has been addressed anywhere, but I had an interaction I didn't understand.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>La Capitan stole the Void Cloak from Writhe and put it under her deck. His turn came up, and i tried to use a card to destroy it. \"Void Cloak is not in play\" it tells me. Okay, fine. I use his power to retrieve the Void Cloak. \"Void Cloak is already in play.\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I kind of get what the intended outcome would be, here, since the power lets you search deck or trash. Still, this outcome was a bit odd, at least in the wording of the messages.&nbsp;</p>",
